                <pb facs="1065" n="941" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg941"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">767.68119F&amp;M/3: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Special Mission at Lausanne</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-12-30T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30,
                                1922—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Mission’s 157 of December 28, 3 p.m. Your statement on capitulations is
                    approved. Continue use of your influence to secure a settlement giving adequate
                    guarantees.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
